# <type>(<scope>): <description>
#   imperative, lowercase except acronyms and names, no full stop at the end,
#   ~50 chars (max 72)
#
# Spec: https://www.conventionalcommits.org
# Types: feat fix docs refactor perf test build ci chore style(=formatting) revert
#   temp = temporary change (custom)
# Breaking change: add ! after the type/scope, e.g. feat(api)!: remove v1 upload endpoint
#
# [optional body: what changed and why, wrapped at 72 chars]
#
# [optional footers, one per line]
#   BREAKING CHANGE: <what breaks and how to migrate>
#   Refs: GENIE-123 (e.g. JIRA ticket, GitHub issue)
#   Co-Authored-By: Name <email>
#
# Lines starting with # are hints and are removed from the commit message.
